.TH FOSC 1 "September 2026" "fossc 1.0.0" "Linux Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
.B fossc
\- FOSS Club KIET operational handbook and gateway
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fossc
.RB [ \-\-discord ]
.RB [ \-\-bootcamp ]
.RB [ \-\-meeting\ tuesday-5pm ]
.RB [ \-\-research\-paper ]
.RB [ \-\-quote ]
.RB [ \-\-members ]
.RI [ command ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B FOSS Club KIET
is the student-led software freedom collective at KIET Deemed To Be
University. We run open labs in
.B Room H808 or H108
(confirm on Discord once temporarily) every day after class hours conclude.
Run with no arguments,
.B fossc
opens a full-screen terminal gazette mirroring the official website,
.UR https://www.fossclubkiet.org
.UE :
masthead, sidebar widgets and editorial views.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B frontpage
Front page of the weekly edition (default view).
.TP
.B weekly
Weekly edition.
.TP
.B man
The man fossc(1) view.
.TP
.B bootcamp
Linux Basics & Open-Source History Bootcamp dossier.
.TP
.B members
Member roster, Academic Year 2026\-27.
.TP
.B discord
Open the Discord invite in your browser.
.SH MEETINGS & TIMINGS
.TS
tab(|);
l l l.
Cadence|Time & Schedule|Venue / Details
_
Daily Hours|Everyday after classes|Room H808 or H108 (confirm on Discord)
Weekly Sync|Every Tuesday @ 5:00 PM|General meetings & lightning talks
Paper Group|Monthly|Systems & architecture review
.TE
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-discord
Print and open the Discord invite (https://discord.gg/JK272Ef8Pm).
.TP
.B \-\-bootcamp
Print the full bootcamp dossier.
.TP
.BI \-\-meeting\ " when"
Print the meetings table; the schedule to show:
.BR tuesday-5pm " (default weekly sync with countdown), " daily ", " paper .
.TP
.B \-\-research\-paper
Print the monthly research paper reading circle notice.
.TP
.B \-\-quote
Print today's quote of the day (same pick as the website).
.TP
.B \-\-members
Print the member roster.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print version information and exit.
.SH KEYS (GAZETTE)
.TP
.B 1\-6
Jump to a view.
.TP
.B \[la]/\[ra], h/l, tab
Switch views.
.TP
.B \[ua]/\[da], k/j, pgup/pgdn
Scroll the articles (mouse wheel works too).
.TP
.B o
Open the Discord invite in the browser.
.TP
.B O
Open the website in the browser.
.TP
.B y
Copy the bootcamp announcement text.
.TP
.B d
Toggle light/dark theme.
.TP
.B q
Quit.
